ssess and manage these exposures.\nL788: \nL789: E – Property and Equipment, Net\nL790: A summary of property and equipment is as follows:\nL791:  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\nL792: (In thousands)  | July 31, 2026  |  | April 30, 2026\nL793:  |  |  |\nL794: Land  | $  | 11,576   |  |  | $  | 11,883   |\nL795: Buildings and improvements  | 18,686   |  |  | 21,718   |\nL796: Furniture, fixtures and equipment  | 24,510   |  |  | 25,911   |\nL797: Leasehold improvements  | 35,951   |  |  | 47,261   |\nL798: Construction in progress  | 313   |  |  | 297   |\nL799:  |  |  |\nL800: Less: accumulated depreciation and amortization  | (50,949)  |  |  | (64,215)  |\nL801:  |  |  |\nL802: Property and equipment, net  | $  | 40,087   |  |  | $  | 42,855   |\nL803: F – Accrued Liabilities\nL804: \nL805: A summary of accrued liabilities is as follows:\nL806:  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\nL807: (In thousands)  | July 31, 2026  |  | April 30, 2026\nL808:  |  |  |\nL809: Employee compensation and benefits  | $  | 7,265   |  |  | $  | 9,020   |\nL810: Deferred sales tax (see Note C)  | 11,688   |  |  | 8,591   |\nL811: Fair value of contingent consideration  | 5,768   |  |  | 5,768   |\nL812: Accrued interest payable  | 990   |  |  | 805   |\nL813: Property taxes payable  | 1,738   |  |  | 1,433   |\nL814: Unearned revenue  | 5,518   |  |  | 5,331   |\nL815: Other  | 1,852   |  |  | 4,953   |\nL816:  |  |  |\nL817: Total Accrued Liabilities  | $  | 34,819   |  |  | $  | 35,901   |\nL818: 24\nL819: \nL820: * * *\nL821: \nL822: 【0†Table】 【0†of Contents】\nL823: \nL824: G – Debt Facilities\nL825: \nL826: A summary of debt facilities is as follows:\nL827:  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\nL828: (In thousands)  | July 31, 2026  |  | April 30, 2026\nL829:  |  |  |\n"
